{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"一、六年。春王三月壬午，〈木巳〉伯姑容卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"二、夏，宋華弱來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"三、秋，葬〈木巳〉桓公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"四、滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"五、莒人滅鄫。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"六、冬，叔孫豹如邾婁。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"七、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，齊侯滅萊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_156_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_156","textTraditional":"曷為不言萊君出奔？國滅，君死之，正也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}